  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43814001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇怪的优纪",
          "text": "|101|，欢迎回来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪，你知道可露莎在哪吗？我在找她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇怪的优纪",
          "text": "可露莎吗？我也没见到，应该是和萤火小队一起出任务去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇怪的优纪",
          "text": "既然提到了可露莎，我其实很想知道一件事——主人是怎样看待她的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814006",
              "text": "人还不错。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43814006",
              "text": "有点莽撞。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇怪的优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯，还有呢？你喜欢她的作品吗？最喜欢哪一幅？你觉得她的滑板涂什么颜色好看？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814008",
              "text": "你不是优纪吧？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43814008",
              "text": "……你是可露莎？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "哈哈哈，不愧是你，这么快就识破啦！看来，下次我要认真准备cos道具才行~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814010",
              "text": "为什么想cos优纪？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "首先，我可是《奇迹少女优纪》的忠实粉丝！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "其次，「可露莎」本人不在场的情况下，更容易问出你对她的真实评价吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "真是可惜，最关键的问题还没问出口呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814014",
              "text": "现在问也不迟。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "其实也没什么啦，就是……你看到的我，是什么颜色的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814016",
              "text": "色盲测试？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43814016",
              "text": "我的视力没问题。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "就是……除了原本的颜色之外，好像还能看到轻飘飘的彩虹、亮晶晶的星光……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "……类似这种感觉，你在看到我的时候，是不是也同样会有？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814019",
              "text": "「也同样」？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43814019",
              "text": "你看到我脸上有彩虹？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814018",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "……欸？……这，我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "啊哈哈哈，你、你看，外面的阳光多明媚呀，是个练习滑板的好天气！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43814022",
              "text": "今天多云。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43814022",
              "text": "你的视力没问题吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43814021",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43814022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "可露莎",
          "text": "总、总之我先走了，下次再聊哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
